{"unit_id":"Guan-HP__dsh-zhijiang-connector#card-zh","repo":"Guan-HP/dsh-zhijiang-connector","commit":"53b1943f3b8e05e40c955669a59d4790a818da0f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zhijiang-connector（DSH 网页插件）：把开物云 New API 中转站的余额与消耗接入网页侧栏。它在侧栏提供余额徽标和可展开面板，并在设置页管理站点、刷新间隔及凭据。主要显示账户余额、密钥额度与消耗、近 24 小时用量、日均消耗和余额可用天数，也提供充值页入口；额度不足时按阈值提示，刷新失败时保留最近快照。适合需要在 DSH 中查看开物云账户余量和消费趋势的用户。需要站点 API 密钥；要读取钱包余额还需配置 dashboard access token。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:291-310","lib/client.js:1034-1053","lib/service.js:200-220"]}
{"unit_id":"Guan-HP__dsh-zhijiang-connector#card-en","repo":"Guan-HP/dsh-zhijiang-connector","commit":"53b1943f3b8e05e40c955669a59d4790a818da0f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zhijiang-connector shows Kaiwu Cloud balance and spending in the DSH web sidebar. Its badge and panel show wallet balance, key usage, daily spend, runway, alerts, and a wallet link. It keeps the last snapshot if refresh fails. An API key is required; a dashboard token enables wallet balance.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:291-310","lib/client.js:1034-1053","lib/service.js:200-220"]}
